    "body": "I don't understand how step 2 is involved, because step 2 operates only on nodes, and ::first-letter/::first-line do not affect nodes---they only affect CSS boxes. The CSS boxes produced by node are discussed in step 4, so that is why I think step 4 is more related. Am I misunderstanding?",
