    "created_at": "2018-07-23T04:11:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-07-23T04:11:01Z",
    "body": ">Isn't `visibility` inherited into the first-letter / first-line? Why would you need to explicitly check them?\r\n\r\nWe can specify `visibility` for first-letter/first-line part.\r\n``css\r\np::first-letter { visibility: hidden }\r\n``\r\nin this case, first-letter patter is hidden but remaining part is visible.\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
